  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c62b495ef9243d944895c3c92ecaca87, type: 3}
  m_Name: Demo1Give
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSO
  dialogueId: 1
  lines:
  - speakerName: Villager
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9df89f95df21769408e089e157cc5b2e, type: 3}
    text: There have been many buildings damaged, first we need to get the lumber
      camp working or it will be as cold as Friggs tits come night fall.
  - speakerName: Villager
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9df89f95df21769408e089e157cc5b2e, type: 3}
    text: Repair the camp and gather enough wood to keep us going a while.
  - speakerName: Villager
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9df89f95df21769408e089e157cc5b2e, type: 3}
    text: You can chop down any tree marked with a red cross. They grow back fast,
      only the Norns know why.
  - speakerName: Villager
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9df89f95df21769408e089e157cc5b2e, type: 3}
    text: Well then, will you help?
  offersQuest: 1
